<script setup lang="ts">import {onMounted,ref} from 'vue';import {useRouter} from 'vue-router';import {stage3Api} from '@/api/stage3';const router=useRouter(),loading=ref(true),data=ref<any>({metrics:{},hot_events:[],trends:[],source_health:[],source_warnings:[]});onMounted(async()=>{try{data.value=await stage3Api.dashboard()}finally{loading.value=false}})</script>
<template><main class="stage-page"><header class="page-head"><div><p>DASHBOARD / PLATFORM SITUATION</p><h1>情报态势看板</h1><span>聚合真实采集量、事件、风险和来源健康。</span></div><button @click="router.push('/sources')">数据源中心</button></header><section v-if="loading" class="empty">正在计算指标…</section><template v-else><section v-if="!data.has_data" class="empty"><strong>暂无可聚合的真实数据</strong><p>请先同步至少一个数据源。看板不会填充演示指标。</p><button @click="router.push('/sources')">前往同步</button></section><template v-else><div class="metrics"><article><span>采集内容</span><b>{{data.metrics.content}}</b></article><article><span>事件</span><b>{{data.metrics.events}}</b></article><article><span>风险事件</span><b>{{data.metrics.risk_events}}</b></article><article><span>真实预警</span><b>{{data.metrics.alerts}}</b></article></div><div class="two-grid"><section><div class="section-title"><h2>热点事件</h2></div><button v-for="item in data.hot_events" :key="item.id" class="event-row" @click="router.push('/events/'+item.id)"><div><strong>{{item.title}}</strong><small>可信度 {{Math.round(item.confidence)}} · 风险 {{Math.round(item.risk_score)}}</small></div><b>{{Math.round(item.heat_score)}}</b></button></section><section><div class="section-title"><h2>来源健康</h2></div><div v-for="source in data.source_health" :key="source.id" class="event-row"><div><strong>{{source.name}}</strong><small>{{source.last_error||'最近同步无错误'}}</small></div><i :class="source.status">{{source.status}}</i></div></section></div></template></template></main></template><style scoped src="@/assets/styles/stage3.css"></style>
